OL,3,GNEWSAGreens quit coalition as council
OL,4,Aloses majority
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been left without a
OL,7,Fmajority after two Green councillors
OL,8,Fquit a Liberal Democrat-led coalition.
OL,10,FLara Davenport-Ray and Stephen Ferguson
OL,11,Fsaid they had lost confidence in the
OL,12,Fjoint administration at Huntingdonshire
OL,13,FDistrict Council.
OL,15,FBoth said one of the reasons for the
OL,16,Fdecision was the council's handling of
OL,17,Fproposals to build on car parks in St
OL,18,FNeots, Huntingdon and St Ives.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
