OL,3,GNEWSAGreens quit coalition as council
OL,4,Aloses majority
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrats said: "The Liberal Democrats
OL,8,Fare thankful to the work that Green
OL,9,Fcolleagues have done over the past four
OL,10,Fyears as part of the HDC joint
OL,11,Fadministration."
